# Modifier System

Coming soon — this page explains the modifier mechanism: why
`.FontSize(24).Bold().Padding(8)` is a chain of modifier records (not
direct property writes), how modifiers compose with reconciliation,
how to author custom modifiers, and why modifiers aren't mutating
extension methods. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Styling](styling.md) covers the surface chainable API.
